            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-obsidian-900/80 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-white font-bold mb-6 flex items-center space-x-3">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator text-gold-500"></i>
              <span>Plan Your Wealth Allocation</span>
            </h3>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
              <div class="space-y-6">
                <div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
